# Allow only container configuration and public website files into the build.
**
!Dockerfile
!nginx-main.conf
!nginx.conf
!html/
!html/**
# Preserve the existing exclusions, including metadata nested in vendor folders.
**/.git
**/.codex
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
**/AGENT.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
